"description": "Pirelli & C. SpA is a consumer tyre company, which engages in manufacturing and marketing of tires for motor and industrial vehicles and motorcycles. It operates as a supplier to brands, such as Aston Martin, Bentley, Ferrari, Porsche, and Maserati, and the sole supplier for Lamborghini, McLaren, and Pagani Automobili. The company was founded by Giovanni Battista Pirelli on January 28, 1872 and is headquartered in Milan, Italy.",
